Article 51-4 (Reporting of Commencement of Business) A person who intends to file a report on the commencement of business under Article 116-4 (1) of the Decree shall submit a report on the commencement of business to the head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business.
  [This Article Newly Inserted on May 24, 1999]

Article 51-5 (Application for Exemption from Customs Duties, etc.) A person who intends to apply for exemption from customs duties, individual consumption tax and value-added tax pursuant to Article 121-3 (3) of the Act shall submit an application for exemption from customs duties, individual consumption tax and value-added tax to the head of a customs office accompanied by the following documents: <Amended on Mar. 6, 2004; Mar. 11, 2005; Feb. 28, 2012>
